 "id": "gen2-a-sleep-talk-rest-counts-the-turn-it-slept-through",
 "notes": [
  "Gen 2 OU: Flaaffy, put to sleep by Sleep Powder, sleeps through turns 6, 7 and (after a switch) 13; on turn 14 it is still asleep (`cant|p2a: Flaaffy|slp`), and its Sleep Talk calls Rest, which puts it to sleep anew. The replay read the sleep's time off the turns before that action alone \u2014 the new sleep ended its search before the turn it slept through counted \u2014 and the engine woke Flaaffy on turn 14. The turn a Sleep Talk sleeps through counts before the sleep it calls (DESIGN.md R-M11-32). Minimized from the Nightly battle m9-gen2ou-s295-011"
 ],
